mlx-fftformer-swift
===================

Port code: MIT (this repository).

Upstream model and weights
--------------------------
FFTformer — https://github.com/kkkls/FFTformer
Kong et al., "Efficient Frequency Domain-based Transformers for High-Quality
Image Deblurring", CVPR 2023.

License: MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 kkkls. See LICENSE-upstream.

The upstream repository commits its pretrained weights in-repo
(`pretrain_model/fftformer_GoPro.pth`) under that same MIT license — there is no
separate weights statement to interpret, which is the favourable case.

Converted weights are redistributed as:
  https://huggingface.co/mlx-community/FFTformer-GoPro-fp32

The upstream repository vendors a copy of BasicSR (Apache-2.0) as its training
framework. This port depends on NONE of it: only the ~300-line architecture file
was read, and no upstream code is vendored here.
